 "After pretraining, “The cat sat on the” → “ mat” works fine, but asking a <0>question</0> may get you… more questions, because the base model just continues documents. SFT and preference tuning turn it into an assistant.": "",
 "▼ Dive in: <0>Stages compared</0>": "",
 "<0>Pretraining</0> on a huge pile of text teaches next-token prediction — this is where almost all knowledge and compute go.": "",
 "<0>SFT</0> (supervised fine-tuning) on curated conversations teaches the <1>format</1> of being an assistant.": "",
 "<0>Preference tuning</0> (RLHF, DPO, RLAIF…) nudges which of several plausible answers the model prefers.": "",
 "Every stage uses the same network and the same forward pass — only the data and the loss change.": "",
